DoH encrypts DNS queries in HTTPS traffic, bypassing traditional DNS inspection. Malware uses DoH to resolve C2 domains while appearing as normal web traffic.

**Detection:**
- *Zeek*: Monitor DNS-over-HTTPS via JA3 fingerprint:
  ```zeek
  event http_header(c: connection, is_orig: bool, name: string, value: string) {
      if (c$http?$ja3s && |value| > 0 && name == "host") {
          NOTICE([$note=DoH_Activity, $msg=fmt("DoH query: %s", value)]);
      }
  }
  ```
- *FireEye NX*: Enable *SSL inspection* and *DNS-over-HTTPS blocking* via policy.

